    "body": "Why would we disable stopImmediatePropagation or stopPropagation. I don't see any strong reasons for that.\r\n\r\nAbout listeners only for trusted events, Gecko has had wantsTrusted option / 4th param for privileged JS for ages\r\nhttps://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/85b4f7363292b272eb9b606e00de2c37a6be73f0/dom/webidl/EventTarget.webidl#21,26,42",
